ame>Bourguet</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Chevillon</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Pasteur</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1998</year><article-title>Evolution of resistance in <named-content content-type="genus-species">Culex pipiens</named-content>: allele replacement and changing environment</article-title><source>Evolution</source><volume>52</volume><fpage>443</fpage><lpage>453</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pgen-0030205-b016"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Labb&#x000e9;</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Lenormand</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Raymond</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>On the worldwide spread of an insecticide resistance gene: a role for local selection</article-title><source>J Evol Biol</source><volume>18</volume><fpage>1471</fpage><lpage>1484</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16313460</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pgen-0030205-b017"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Raymond</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Berticat</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Weill</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Pasteur</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Chevillon</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Insecticide resistance in the mosquito Culex pipiens: what have we learned about adaptation?</article-title><source>Genetica</source><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11838760</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pgen-0030205-b018"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Weill</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surna